Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add UCI ElectricityLoadDiagrams20112014 loader for a
 real-power baseline

- src/load_uci.py: reads LD2011_2014.txt/.zip in chunks, picks 5 household-scale
  clients active for a 30-day window, averages 15-min kW to hourly
- generate_dataset/detect_anomalies/evaluate: --uci option; same injection,
  detection and evaluation on measured power with simulated V/I
- power_source column; tests on a fake file in the real format

